2. Updating client workstations

Before you can upgrade IBM Software Hub, you must ensure that the workstation has a supported version of the IBM Software Hub command-line interface, the OpenShift command-line interface, and the Helm command-line interface.

User icon All administrators When icon Repeat as needed
What to do

    Complete Updating client workstations (Upgrading from Version 5.1 to Version 5.3).
    Go to the appropriate section based on your environment:
        If your cluster is in a restricted network, go to 3. Preparing to run upgrades in a restricted network.
        If you plan to mirror images to a private container registry, go to 4. Preparing to run upgrades from a private container registry.
        If you plan to pull images from the IBM Entitled Registry, go to 5. Preparing your cluster.

